WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,660
There is running water now

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:02,580
Let it sit on top first

3
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,810
If the steamboat is flooded, cut this

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:06,950
After filtering and soaking

5
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:08,990
At least there is no need to use the reserve of water for washing and living.

6
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:16,840
Mom, this is broken

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,200
It's not bad. Look at mom.

8
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:21,970
Baby is coming

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:32,540
This is true often

10
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,640
Things in supermarkets are too expensive

11
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,160
All the money we brought was spent

12
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,240
That's all I bought back.

13
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:42,180
How do you differentiate between so many people?

14
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,260
Get as much as you pay

15
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,980
Eight of us ventured out.

16
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,500
Of course we pick this batch first

17
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,780
There are also those who used our boat to pick up supplies today.

18
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,100
Each family pays another five hundred rent
